WEBVTT

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:20.010
Rental Magica

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.470
What a tasteful place.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.930
It's so nice and quiet.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.740
Oh, this is just heavenly!

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.780
Well, Honami?

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.750
Hmm...

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.990
No good. The effect seems a bit weak.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.830
The source's power may be weak, too.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.660
I wonder if this is going to be of
any help to the president's eye.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.630
And after we took the trouble to come out here.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.200
Well, then...

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.300
What do we do?

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:34.580
Oh, cut it out!

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:38.610
Anyway, this hot spring's
power won't be enough.

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:41.850
Maybe we should head someplace else.

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:44.260
I just got a great idea.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.430
Mikan!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.760
No way!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.400
It's all right.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:54.130
B-But, mixed bathing is! Well...

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.940
Since we came to this hot
spring to treat your eye,

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:01.070
there shouldn't be a problem with
all of us going in at the same time.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.900
But, mixed bathing is still...

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:15.160
No, it's not gonna work!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.820
Mr. President, let me make things clear!

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:20.530
Why did I come here?
Why would I, a magazine editor,

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.220
come here with a deadline drawing near?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.370
It's all because of THIS!

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.630
Not for my sake, huh?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.270
Nothing can stop this!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.340
Come on, Byakko, Genbu. Let's go!

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:34.980
Oh?

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:37.200
Nekoyashiki!

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.340
Boss?

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:50.250
Boss, you're bleeding again!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.630
Does your eye hurt? Are you okay?

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:56.420
Huh! No! This is just... I'm fine! I'm fine!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:03.000
She just came out of the bath...
She smells nice.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.240
Boss?

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.470
Nothing! It's nothing!

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:10.210
Really? Well then, we're leaving.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.640
Get ready too, sir.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.400
Right now? Where to?

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:15.540
To look for a hot spring!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.120
What?!

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.940
Now then,

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:21.860
Episode 8
HOT SPRING MAGIC

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.960
Episode 8
HOT SPRING MAGIC
is everyone ready?

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:23.520
Episode 8
HOT SPRING MAGIC

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:24.290
Episode 8
HOT SPRING MAGIC
All together now!

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:24.930
All together now!

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:29.760
I'll follow you, I'll follow you...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.970
So, that last hot spring was no good?

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.270
I thought it would work,

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.670
but it didn't have the power to halt the
progression of the contamination in your eye.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:42.680
I think the heavy rains last week...

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:46.240
...changed the flow of the ley
line running through this mountain.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.010
Hot springs are built atop ley lines.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:53.150
So, we need to find a ley line, right?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.550
But, how?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.390
That's easy.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.490
I need to borrow this.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:13.170
Come forth, Shax!
Great marquis who commands 30 legions!

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:20.770
Shax! Seek the light of a ley line!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.220
That'll find one fast.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.080
Then I can see to the treatment myself.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.920
You'll what? What am I, your hunting dog?!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.890
It can't be helped.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:34.060
I'm the only one here who can do it.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:39.400
Well, I guess it's true you had no
chance of finding a ley line by yourself.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.200
Say what?!

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.400
Mountains are where Celtic magic got its start!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.940
I would've found one faster than
that pigeon of yours, Addie!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.640
Oh, you think so?

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:52.080
My Shax will be back before you can find one.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.580
Ow, ow, ow...

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:01.790
Um, do you think those two might be the
source of the spell wave contamination?

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:02.350
Shh!

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:08.190
Here!

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:09.790
Then let's get to it!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.430
Wait!

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:13.160
Huh?

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:17.330
If you just start digging into a mountain,
you'll anger the local gods.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.500
I'll purify it first.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:25.370
Since this is essentially a ground breaking
ceremony, let's leave this to Mikan.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:32.780
Even though I am most impure,
I ask that you cleanse me and grant clarity,

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.980
Both within and without.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.120
There, it should be okay now.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.020
It would have been trouble if we'd
caused spell wave contamination, too.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.460
Okay, now then...

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:47.860
Come forth, Procell! Duke who is a
vessel of discipline and righteousness!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.270
Go, Procell!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.810
Procell... I've never seen him before.

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.880
Hot springs can even be blessed
with the magic of Solomon, as well.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:07.460
Amazing, isn't it?

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.050
Yeah.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:13.690
Summoning a demon like that just to dig
a hot spring is an amazing mistake, isn't it?

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:14.160
Yeah!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.400
Okay, all set.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.010
It's cold!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.470
Well, it is water.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.080
Addie, really!

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.480
Oh? That's strange.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:45.050
It's a water pipe.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.260
Addie, what's the big idea?!

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.090
This is the spot you found, isn't it?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.260
Ow, ow, ow...

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.800
I won't rely on you anymore, Addie!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.470
I'll show you the power of Celtic magic!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:03.940
Hail!

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.110
Fauni, horned gods of the forest!

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.180
Give your blessing to your children!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.790
Wow!

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.080
Ow, ow, ow...

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.350
Brother Pres! Are you okay?

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:31.730
There it is!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.470
What's?

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.440
Money boxes!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.340
This is amazing! You found treasure!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.420
You're incredible, Big Sister Honami!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.550
Ah well,

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:45.520
that's because you're always worried
about repaying your loans, isn't it?

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:48.920
That's why you dug that up instead. Poor girl.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:56.760
HAIL!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.630
We don't need that!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.230
They've completely lost the point
of us being out here, haven't they?

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.810
Y-Yeah.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:14.640
All your big talk, and you just dig up
some old Japanese coins by mistake.

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:18.110
Celtic magic isn't that impressive, is it?

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:22.950
Like you were so much more impressive
having Procell bust a water main?!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.080
What did you say?

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.680
What? You wanna piece of me?!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.460
Um, you two?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.800
Since we came out here,
why don't we have fun and look?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:34.200
Oh! Why don't we make this a
contest to see who finds it first?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.360
Exactly.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:38.770
We're all hungry, so let's just
find it and get back quickly.

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:40.600
Contest?

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:44.570
I'm not that wild about the idea, but...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.310
What if the winner gets a prize?

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:50.980
For me, I'd like a year's supply of cat food.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:54.820
I'd like a new cup. My old one broke.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.260
I want to have a cake buffet!

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.620
What would you like, Big Sister Honami?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.160
Well, I don't want anything in particular...

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:07.330
Honami.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:11.870
Thank you for always
protecting me from Adelicia.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.130
Oh, it's nothing.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:16.100
I just worry about you, Icchan.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.070
As a reward, I will grant any request you ask.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.950
Starting today, I will be
your prince alone, Honami.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:27.010
O... Oh, no! This is just so sudden!

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.690
A contest. How absurd.

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.290
Adelicia.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:41.060
Thank you for always
protecting me from Honami.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:43.340
Of... Of course.

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:46.540
I do that because I want to.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.470
It's not for your sake, Itsuki.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:51.580
I love that stubborn streak in you.

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:57.310
Starting today, I pledge myself
to be your knight forever.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:05.550
Why am I suddenly getting a chill worse
than any spell wave contamination?

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.130
All right, let's get this contest started!

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.760
Who can find a hot spring first?

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:17.000
Aren't you participating in
this stupid contest, Honami?

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.370
I... I couldn't care less about any contests!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.970
On your mark!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:26.100
You say that, even though you could
find one instantly with magic?

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.150
Get set!

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:31.210
Hardly. Do it for a prize for first
place? Don't be ridiculous!

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.150
Go!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.280
Full speed ahead, huh?

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.790
I have a terrible foreboding.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.070
Hey, Honami!

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:47.230
You said you weren't interested in this!

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:49.790
And I thought you said this
contest was stupid, Addie!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.070
Well, don't expect any mercy from me!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:53.160
Same goes for me!

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:57.380
Come forth, Marbas!
The king who rules 36 legions!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.380
Dig up a ley line spring!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:04.550
Crap!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:05.480
Hail!

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.990
Wind of the east!
Goddess who transports the light!

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:17.000
You gotta watch out for those
sudden mountain squalls!

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:18.630
You are a piece of work!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.600
So... hot springs?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.200
Now it's my turn!

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.860
Didn't you just block my try?!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.940
Come forth, stone circle!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.310
Earthquake!

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.580
Byakko! Genbu! Barrier positions!

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.620
All right! She struck water!

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.280
Come forth, Furfur!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:52.100
The great duke who commands 26 legions!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:07.450
Oh dear, that seems to have shifted
the ley line's position. How sad!

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:08.810
You!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:09.880
Hail!

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.750
With the divine protection of the mistletoe
which dwells in neither heaven nor earth,

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.520
pierce through the calamity in the east!

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:18.820
Come forth, Eligor!
The mighty knight who leads 60 legions!

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:24.760
Come forth, you who are worshiped by
the people of the holy wood! Wicker Man!

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:27.360
Procell!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:30.230
Bow of the evergreen oak!

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.000
Shax!

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:31.730
Fauni!

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:32.500
Haborym!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.080
Botis!

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.720
I'm starting to get dizzy here.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.750
Landslide!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.450
Oh, man. My eyes are going blurry.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:57.190
Aw, they're spell wave
contaminating everything!

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:00.290
Then let me finish this!

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.360
I'm finishing this!

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.640
Guys! Wait for me!

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:21.020
Is everyone okay?

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.350
I think we're a long way from okay.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:26.480
Where are we?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.690
It looks like a cave.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.830
Let's get out of here.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.900
Honami, get out your broom.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.730
I didn't bring that with me!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.440
And I used all of my mistletoe up before.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.100
Addie, why don't you summon Forneus?!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.480
Oh, well.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.010
The magic circle disappeared!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:54.720
I may have overexerted myself before.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.620
If we wait a bit, I'm sure my power will return.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:05.490
After you said Celtic magic was
unbeatable in the mountains!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:09.830
We wouldn't be in this mess if you
hadn't summoned too many demons, Addie!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.540
Blaming other people, just like you always have!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.440
What did you say?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.340
What about it?!

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.400
I'm hungry.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:21.950
What time is it?

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:26.180
We've been walking around so much,
it must be nearly dawn.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.550
Hey! Take a look at this!

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:33.830
A hot spring...

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.930
The source must be nearby!

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.460
Dead end.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.000
But there's hot water coming
from underneath here.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:47.930
Mr. President!

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.180
Itsuki, look.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:57.540
A sacred Shinto rope?

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:00.780
This seems to be the guardian
spirit of the mountain.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:02.250
Guardian spirit?

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:06.460
It was probably up at the top of the mountain,

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:09.520
but the rains or something
else caused it to fall in here.

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:12.330
So, if we put this back where it belongs...

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:14.830
Why not try?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.500
How's this?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:21.740
Good moon.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.540
A perfect full moon for replenishing magic.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.910
The ley line's been split by
the hole caused by the cave-in.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:37.250
Essentially, the rock in that hole
kept the ley line flowing on course.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:43.160
If this rock is essentially a giant
fetish, then this will work!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:46.200
Come forth, Marbas! Forneus!

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:56.770
Hi, fu, mi, yo, i, mu, na,
ya, ko, to, mochirorane!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.240
Here we go!

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:00.640
Hail!

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.120
With the life of the holy wood
protection of the moon,

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.020
spin your blessed thread!

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.080
Marbas! Forneus!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.950
It's caught on something!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:39.610
Something's been interfering.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:42.390
The energy flow's stagnated.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.050
The moon!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.970
Byakko! Seiryu! Genbu! Suzaku!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:59.110
Kouji of the northern sky!
Kanchi of the southern sky!

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.100
Raikou of the western sky!
Keiji of the eastern sky!

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.640
I command you! I command you! I command you!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.320
Nekoyashiki! Thanks!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.190
But something's still holding it.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:22.660
Could that be it?!

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:24.090
Mr. President!

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:37.970
Byakko! Seiryu! Genbu! Suzaku!

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:44.250
Please! Let the moon
stay out just a little longer!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.320
Addie!

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.860
Hail! Beautiful Dione!

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:05.830
Jewel of growth and life! Jewel of
fulfillment! Kunikototachi no Mikoto!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:31.890
First!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.900
Ah! That did it.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.900
Looks like the hot spring's
gotten its effectiveness back.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.630
It should work on the president's eye now.

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:42.670
That's good.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.970
Nice work, Addie.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.680
Hey, Addie,

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:56.220
when that rock was falling,
why didn't you run away?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:59.250
Did I need to run away?

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:05.260
Everyone was helping everyone else
to lift that rock, weren't they?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.260
Yeah, but still...

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:10.230
Oh, never mind.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:18.780
Mixed bathing really is the best, isn't it?

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.140
What's wrong, Mr. President?

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:25.580
Don't you think having everyone
in the bath like this is great?

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:28.750
Why are you bathing with the cats?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:34.150
Do you realize how hard it is to find a
hot spring that lets you bathe with animals?

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:36.790
Can't you just do that at home?

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:39.870
Good job tonight, Mr. President.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.660
That was a real calamity, wasn't it?

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:47.440
At least we know just how good
those two are at practicing magic.

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:49.930
Magic is all about concentration.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:53.710
No matter how skilled they may be at magic,

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.180
they can't do anything if they can't concentrate.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.650
I think your ability to draw
out their concentration...

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.620
...may be just as impressive, Mr. President.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:06.060
I didn't do anything. I just want
everyone to get along, so...

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:09.830
What?! Addie, what do you mean I can't?!

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:13.730
I just said I'm going to turn
this into a Goetia spa!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.300
There they go again.

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:19.040
And just why would you come
here with our company president?!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:24.570
There's nothing wrong with entertaining
the president of a rival company!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.210
I'm the only one who can use
this hot spring to treat him!

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:29.080
There wouldn't be any point
in you going in with him!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.790
Fine, I'll put some hot water
in a cup and send it to you.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:32.850
Which means it's okay for me to come, too!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:33.850
Well, I think I'll head in now.
Which means it's okay for me to come, too!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:34.890
Well, I think I'll head in now.
You don't have to!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:35.450
Huh?!

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:56.710
I hate hot springs now.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:07.810
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:16.220
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:29.270
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:41.190
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:47.460
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:51.960
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:56.240
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:01.330
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:13.210
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.260
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.490
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:24.590
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

