00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.900
Hot Springs [ONSEN]
Hot springs are connected to magic?

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:30.740
Hot Springs [ONSEN]
It's been a magical standard for the Celts
and the Romans since ancient times.

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:31.870
It's been a magical standard for the Celts
and the Romans since ancient times.

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:34.540
They can give you luck in wealth and chance.

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:35.310
Luck in wealth?!

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:37.910
Shame about those money boxes,
huh, Prof. Miwa?

